title: Menu: "Hide from the canvas" on a file card, then "Put hidden files back" from the canvas menu
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left none
right none
fit
wait 1000
menu 640 400
wait 500
ui click 740 421
wait 1200
mark file-hidden
wait 500
left files
wait 700
mark file-hidden-explorer
wait 500
left none
wait 600
fit
wait 900
menu 200 500
wait 500
mark canvas-menu
wait 400
ui click 300 575
wait 1200
mark put-back
wait 500
quit
